{"4253860": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cooking Cat-astrophe", "steam_appid": 4253860, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cooking Cat-astrophe</strong> is a cozy yet fast-paced cooking game starring an adorable cat chef struggling to stay in control of chaotic, ever-changing kitchens. Cook multiple burger patties at once, watch their timing carefully, and prevent them from burning. Chop ingredients, assemble burgers step by step, and serve completed orders quickly to keep up with the growing demand. Wash dishes to free up workspace and maintain efficiency while managing several tasks simultaneously.<br><br>Select levels and face kitchens that shift and reorganize themselves, forcing you to adapt your workflow and think ahead. Master multitasking, refine your timing, and overcome increasingly demanding challenges where speed, precision, and smart prioritization define your success.<br><br>Unlock skill upgrades to enhance your cat chef’s performance and collect unique skins to customize your character. With simple controls, a warm cartoony atmosphere, and a charming feline protagonist, Cooking Cat-astrophe delivers satisfying, engaging cooking gameplay where every action matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Select and Master Levels</strong></h2>Choose levels and adapt to unique kitchen layouts. Each stage introduces new spatial challenges that test your efficiency, timing, and multitasking skills.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253860/extras/a858696a4f738165061d1f7f3089c2be.poster.avif?t=1783177134\" width=1138 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253860/extras/a858696a4f738165061d1f7f3089c2be.webm?t=1783177134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253860/extras/a858696a4f738165061d1f7f3089c2be.mp4?t=1783177134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Chop Ingredients</strong></h2>Prepare ingredients by chopping them at the cutting station. Proper preparation ensures faster assembly and smoother kitchen operation.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253860/extras/d051287d884c6af3bce05366114955a4.poster.avif?t=1783177134\" width=1138 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253860/extras/d051287d884c6af3bce05366114955a4.webm?t=1783177134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253860/extras/d051287d884c6af3bce05366114955a4.mp4?t=1783177134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cook Multiple Patties</strong></h2>Manage the grill and cook several burger patties at the same time. Monitor their progress, prevent burning, and keep the production flow efficient as the kitchen pressure increases.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253860/extras/b3908dde89bad07c5fe700242df16265.poster.avif?t=1783177134\" width=1138 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253860/extras/b3908dde89bad07c5fe700242df16265.webm?t=1783177134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253860/extras/b3908dde89bad07c5fe700242df16265.mp4?t=1783177134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Assemble Burgers</strong></h2>Combine buns, patties, and ingredients to assemble complete burgers. Accuracy and speed are essential to fulfill orders correctly and maintain momentum.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253860/extras/5148f8951f0764632e26405d431ee325.poster.avif?t=1783177134\" width=1138 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253860/extras/5148f8951f0764632e26405d431ee325.webm?t=1783177134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253860/extras/5148f8951f0764632e26405d431ee325.mp4?t=1783177134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Serve Orders</strong></h2>Deliver completed burgers to the serving area and keep customers satisfied. Efficient delivery ensures smoother progression and prevents workflow bottlenecks.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253860/extras/5c762dc2a5581cd0ebb7d1b46c1451c4.poster.avif?t=1783177134\" width=1138 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253860/extras/5c762dc2a5581cd0ebb7d1b46c1451c4.webm?t=1783177134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253860/extras/5c762dc2a5581cd0ebb7d1b46c1451c4.mp4?t=1783177134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Keep All Clean</strong></h2>Clean dirty plates &amp; floor to free up essential workspace, have plates for orders and don't slow down. <br>Maintaining clean equipment is critical for sustaining continuous production.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253860/ex